If you was just a little bit older.

00:09:31.090 --> 00:09:33.140
And, you know, I was real fast, you know.

00:09:35.510 --> 00:09:36.950
He told me that,

00:09:36.950 --> 00:09:37.910
when I got out that girl's home,

00:09:37.910 --> 00:09:40.270
I happened to run into him downtown,

00:09:40.270 --> 00:09:41.350
down here and...

00:09:42.850 --> 00:09:43.853
On Fifth and,

00:09:46.590 --> 00:09:49.140
what's that, comin' from Broadway?

00:09:49.140 --> 00:09:51.140
- [Mark] San Pedro?
- San Pedro, yeah.

00:09:51.140 --> 00:09:55.383
And there was a Fat
Burger, the hard rock bar.

00:09:57.260 --> 00:09:58.093
I used to meet him,

00:09:58.093 --> 00:09:58.926
'cause this is where my mom was too.

00:09:58.926 --> 00:10:00.050
So, you know...

00:10:00.050 --> 00:10:01.020
But I happened to see him,

00:10:01.020 --> 00:10:02.130
I ran into him and he was like,

00:10:02.130 --> 00:10:02.963
when I got into his car,

00:10:02.963 --> 00:10:05.316
He was like, can you give
me a ride to my dad's?

00:10:05.316 --> 00:10:06.149
And I got in his car,

00:10:06.149 --> 00:10:06.982
and he said, my place or yours,

00:10:06.982 --> 00:10:08.973
and we went to the Snooty Fox.

00:10:10.120 --> 00:10:11.690
And I've been doin' what I do

00:10:11.690 --> 00:10:12.730
ever since then, you know,

00:10:12.730 --> 00:10:14.740
it's not like, you know...

00:10:14.740 --> 00:10:15.900
It went from bad to worse,

00:10:15.900 --> 00:10:17.173
from worse to, you know.

00:10:18.200 --> 00:10:20.650
Me bumpin' my head on my experiences,

00:10:20.650 --> 00:10:21.730
or whatever, but...

00:10:22.800 --> 00:10:24.300
That's just how life is, you know.

00:10:24.300 --> 00:10:27.290
- [Mark] So, a 12-year-old,
that gets picked up,

00:10:27.290 --> 00:10:28.940
or starts working as a prostitute,

00:10:28.940 --> 00:10:31.090
with a pimp, especially, is that...

00:10:31.090 --> 00:10:33.640
are you being tricked or
trafficked into doing that?

00:10:33.640 --> 00:10:34.473
- [Tanya] A lot of times,

00:10:34.473 --> 00:10:37.420
those tricks do trick the girls, you know.

00:10:37.420 --> 00:10:38.690
Promises, you know.

00:10:38.690 --> 00:10:41.060
- [Mark] In your case,
was that your decision,

00:10:41.060 --> 00:10:41.893
or somebody else kinda got you into it?

00:10:41.893 --> 00:10:43.810
- [Tanya] I didn't have
a decision, you know,

00:10:43.810 --> 00:10:45.723
he just snatched me up, you know.

00:10:46.609 --> 00:10:48.120
He like, gangster-ed me,

00:10:48.120 --> 00:10:49.111
tellin' me what I'm gonna do,

00:10:49.111 --> 00:10:49.944
you know what I'm saying?

00:10:49.944 --> 00:10:51.710
You know, or what he gonna do to me, so...

00:10:51.710 --> 00:10:54.270
- [Mark] And could you
get out if you wanted to?

00:10:54.270 --> 00:10:56.603
- [Tanya] I didn't think
I could, but I did.

00:10:57.920 --> 00:10:58.820
I ended up gettin' a gun out

00:10:58.820 --> 00:10:59.950
of one of the trick's cars,

00:10:59.950 --> 00:11:00.910
and I pulled it on him,

00:11:00.910 --> 00:11:01.743
and I let him know,

00:11:01.743 --> 00:11:03.100
if he ever hit me again,

00:11:03.100 --> 00:11:06.118
what I was gonna do to him, you know.

00:11:06.118 --> 00:11:08.210
And, they found him in his car.

00:11:08.210 --> 00:11:09.970
Somebody had, gave him a hot-shot,

00:11:09.970 --> 00:11:11.803
and he, you know, he was dead.

00:11:13.642 --> 00:11:15.890
- [Mark] That's how you got away.

00:11:15.890 --> 00:11:17.930
- [Tanya] Yeah.
- [Mark] Wow.

00:11:17.930 --> 00:11:19.090
And do you have children?

00:11:19.090 --> 00:11:20.260
- [Tanya] I have five.

00:11:20.260 --> 00:11:21.480
- [Mark] And did you raise 'em?

00:11:21.480 --> 00:11:22.880
- [Tanya] Yes, three of 'em.

00:11:24.190 --> 00:11:25.740
The other two were drug babies.

00:11:28.440 --> 00:11:29.690
Nothing that I'm proud of,

00:11:29.690 --> 00:11:32.533
but, I am in my kids' life now.

00:11:34.850 --> 00:11:35.810
- [Mark] How are your kids doing?

00:11:35.810 --> 00:11:38.063
- [Tanya] Great, they're doing great.

00:11:39.360 --> 00:11:40.373
Tremendous job.

00:11:41.210 --> 00:11:44.022
I am proud of 'em, I can say that much.

00:11:44.022 --> 00:11:44.957
- [Mark] How old are you now?

00:11:44.957 --> 00:11:45.790
- [Tanya] I will be...

00:11:45.790 --> 00:11:47.891
Thursday's my birthday, I will be 52.

00:11:47.891 --> 00:11:48.849
- [Mark] 52.

00:11:48.849 --> 00:11:50.700
Are you still working the streets?

00:11:50.700 --> 00:11:51.533
- No.

00:11:51.533 --> 00:11:52.366
No, no, no.

00:11:52.366 --> 00:11:53.360
No, no, no.

00:11:53.360 --> 00:11:54.880
That life is over with, for me.

00:11:54.880 --> 00:11:55.963
I'm a married woman.

00:11:58.390 --> 00:12:00.044
Yeah, I've been married for 18 years.

00:12:00.044 --> 00:12:02.920
- [Mark] Well, good for you.

00:12:02.920 --> 00:12:04.430
- That life has been gone.

00:12:04.430 --> 00:12:05.263
Over with.

00:12:05.263 --> 00:12:06.620
- [Mark] What advice
would you give to a girl,

00:12:06.620 --> 00:12:09.520
who's considering doing that for a living?

00:12:09.520 --> 00:12:11.574
- If she can get out, get out, you know.

00:12:11.574 --> 00:12:14.397
Don't go for anything
that anybody tell you,

00:12:14.397 --> 00:12:15.680
'cause it's a lot of ways

00:12:15.680 --> 00:12:18.090
of trickin' a person, you know.

00:12:18.090 --> 00:12:18.923
Sayin' one thing,

00:12:18.923 --> 00:12:21.010
but then it's something else, you know.

00:12:21.010 --> 00:12:21.920
You have to be smart.

00:12:21.920 --> 00:12:23.250
See, like I tell my kids,

00:12:23.250 --> 00:12:24.083
stay in school,

00:12:24.083 --> 00:12:26.270
you don't have to depend
on nobody, you know.

00:12:26.270 --> 00:12:27.170
It's all about education,

00:12:27.170 --> 00:12:29.606
education is power, you know.

00:12:29.606 --> 00:12:30.950
It is.

00:12:30.950 --> 00:12:34.423
Like my baby, she's 17, you know.

00:12:36.064 --> 00:12:37.190
She was a straight-A student,

00:12:37.190 --> 00:12:38.180
and, you know, she told me something,

00:12:38.180 --> 00:12:39.040
and one day she called me

00:12:39.040 --> 00:12:39.890
and told me that,

00:12:41.640 --> 00:12:43.090
she wanted to talk to me, she needed me,

00:12:43.090 --> 00:12:44.790
and I was like, I'm comin', I'm on my way,

00:12:44.790 --> 00:12:46.610
what's wrong, what's wrong?

00:12:46.610 --> 00:12:48.420
She said, I'm just tired of doing drugs.

00:12:48.420 --> 00:12:50.220
I said, drugs?

00:12:50.220 --> 00:12:53.650
Honestly, I didn't know what
to say to her, you know.

00:12:53.650 --> 00:12:54.860
'Cause it was a shock to me,

00:12:54.860 --> 00:12:57.140
you know, it was, like, hard, you know.

00:12:57.140 --> 00:13:00.020
What do I say to my
daughter, I mean, like...

00:13:00.020 --> 00:13:00.980
She told me, she said, mom,

00:13:00.980 --> 00:13:03.550
I know about the drugs, I know what you do

00:13:03.550 --> 00:13:08.190
and it's like, I was
like thrown back, like-

00:13:08.190 --> 00:13:10.730
What do I say to my daughter, you know?

00:13:10.730 --> 00:13:11.820
And she...

00:13:11.820 --> 00:13:13.993
Children mimic their parents.

00:13:15.170 --> 00:13:16.510
They mimic what they see, you know,

00:13:16.510 --> 00:13:19.440
and, that's the last thing
I wanted my daughter,

00:13:19.440 --> 00:13:22.110
you know, she's never seen me do it,

00:13:22.110 --> 00:13:24.253
but, she knew I had a problem.

00:13:25.090 --> 00:13:26.030
She knew.

00:13:26.030 --> 00:13:27.620
Even as a kid, you know,

00:13:27.620 --> 00:13:30.620
from, you know, one on up,

00:13:30.620 --> 00:13:31.460
she knew, I told her,

00:13:31.460 --> 00:13:32.680
I said, well, I do have an addiction,

00:13:32.680 --> 00:13:33.713
and it's a sickness.

00:13:35.210 --> 00:13:36.910
And she used to tell me, I got medicine.

00:13:36.910 --> 00:13:38.350
Nana got medicine in the cabinet.

00:13:38.350 --> 00:13:39.340
No, not that kinda medicine,

00:13:39.340 --> 00:13:41.030
that's not what I want.

00:13:41.030 --> 00:13:41.863
But anyway,

00:13:42.770 --> 00:13:43.900
she told me she did drugs.

00:13:43.900 --> 00:13:45.760
She said she did just about everything.

00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:46.760
She said she tried it,

00:13:46.760 --> 00:13:48.230
and they do it at her school,

00:13:48.230 --> 00:13:49.063
and, that blew my hair back.

00:13:49.063 --> 00:13:52.163
and, that blew my hair back.

00:13:53.520 --> 00:13:54.993
That threw me for a big loop.

00:13:56.120 --> 00:13:56.953
And I told her, I said,

00:13:56.953 --> 00:13:58.993
the next time you get that urge,

00:14:00.410 --> 00:14:01.340
of you're angry,

00:14:01.340 --> 00:14:02.270
you're stressed out,

00:14:02.270 --> 00:14:04.120
or you're bored,

00:14:04.120 --> 00:14:04.980
and, you know, you want-

00:14:04.980 --> 00:14:08.010
just call me, just call me, you know.

00:14:08.010 --> 00:14:10.100
Don't go, use, you know,

00:14:10.100 --> 00:14:10.933
don't do that again,

00:14:10.933 --> 00:14:13.760
because, I found out she was smokin' weed,

00:14:13.760 --> 00:14:14.710
I told her that's not good,

00:14:14.710 --> 00:14:16.490
because see, weed...

00:14:16.490 --> 00:14:17.990
Anything alters the mind,

00:14:17.990 --> 00:14:20.230
takes full control, basically,

00:14:20.230 --> 00:14:21.850
is what I explained to her.

00:14:21.850 --> 00:14:23.890
And you cannot study
in school smoking weed,

00:14:23.890 --> 00:14:24.723
that's when it started,

00:14:24.723 --> 00:14:25.790
from the weed, for her.

00:14:26.650 --> 00:14:29.140
So, my daughter, you know,
she told me she would,

00:14:29.140 --> 00:14:30.740
she'll give me a call, you know.

00:14:31.780 --> 00:14:33.200
Other than that, you know,

00:14:33.200 --> 00:14:34.980
I was shocked when she told
me she tried everything,

00:14:34.980 --> 00:14:37.210
I'm like, you told me you hit the pipe?

00:14:37.210 --> 00:14:38.043
Yes, mom.

00:14:38.043 --> 00:14:40.400
I did the pipe, I did the crystal,

00:14:40.400 --> 00:14:42.540
she told me she shot dope in her arms.

00:14:42.540 --> 00:14:44.310
I said, I wanna know how,

00:14:44.310 --> 00:14:47.090
if you did that, how did it make you feel?

00:14:47.090 --> 00:14:49.210
I mean, what was the side effects?

00:14:49.210 --> 00:14:50.910
How did you feel after you did it?

00:14:51.950 --> 00:14:53.533
She said she was very sick.

00:14:54.710 --> 00:14:56.340
For a couple days, you know.

00:14:56.340 --> 00:14:57.173
I said, good.

00:14:57.173 --> 00:14:59.037
Please don't do that again.

00:14:59.037 --> 00:15:01.470
'Cause that's only effect that I observed,

00:15:01.470 --> 00:15:04.670
towards people being on dope,

00:15:04.670 --> 00:15:06.163
using needles, you know.

00:15:07.359 --> 00:15:10.120
- [Mark] Do you think that teenagers,

00:15:10.120 --> 00:15:11.570
young kids growing up in the-

00:15:12.458 --> 00:15:15.177
- It's different, it's
different, you know.

00:15:16.978 --> 00:15:17.811
'Cause when I was growin' up,

00:15:17.811 --> 00:15:20.157
it wasn't like that, you know.

00:15:20.157 --> 00:15:23.460
- [Mark] But now it seems
like it's the norm, almost.

00:15:23.460 --> 00:15:24.740
- Exactly.

00:15:24.740 --> 00:15:25.573
- [Mark] To do drugs,

00:15:25.573 --> 00:15:27.250
to get into the street
life, to do all this.

00:15:27.250 --> 00:15:30.163
- Yeah, they wanna fit
in, you know, that's all.

00:15:31.450 --> 00:15:34.220
You know, they wanna
become someone, you know.

00:15:34.220 --> 00:15:35.960
or be like someone.

00:15:35.960 --> 00:15:37.125
She always told me she
wanted to be like me,

00:15:37.125 --> 00:15:38.125
- [Mark] I'm sure there's exceptions.

00:15:38.125 --> 00:15:40.303
- But I told her I wanted her
to be better than me, huh?

00:15:40.303 --> 00:15:41.136
- [Mark] I'm sure there's exceptions but-.

00:15:41.136 --> 00:15:41.969
- Absolutely.

00:15:41.969 --> 00:15:43.330
- [Mark] It seems like there's a lot of...

00:15:43.330 --> 00:15:44.470
- Well, you could teach any child,

00:15:44.470 --> 00:15:45.303
you could tell them anything,

00:15:45.303 --> 00:15:46.136
'til they get a certain age,

00:15:46.136 --> 00:15:46.969
their mind is made up

00:15:46.969 --> 00:15:49.347
to do what they wanna do, regardless.

00:15:49.347 --> 00:15:53.060
It's not all about what you taught 'em.

00:15:53.060 --> 00:15:57.220
But, when you unveil the
right teaching to 'em,

00:15:57.220 --> 00:15:59.120
you don't have to worry about that.

00:15:59.120 --> 00:16:00.180
But you don't know what goes on

00:16:00.180 --> 00:16:02.930
when you're not in their presence 24/8.

00:16:02.930 --> 00:16:05.912
You know, so...

00:16:05.912 --> 00:16:06.790
- [Mark] What do you think
the most misunderstood

00:16:06.790 --> 00:16:11.150
thing is about women
that work as prostitutes,

00:16:11.150 --> 00:16:13.440
that outsiders don't understand?

00:16:13.440 --> 00:16:15.407
- You can't teach me nun about the streets

00:16:15.407 --> 00:16:17.360
if you ain't lived it.

00:16:17.360 --> 00:16:18.193
You have to go out there

00:16:18.193 --> 00:16:19.026
and live that life

00:16:19.026 --> 00:16:20.850
in order to know about it.

00:16:20.850 --> 00:16:22.180
Right, some people go to programs

00:16:22.180 --> 00:16:23.350
and stuff like that, you know.

00:16:23.350 --> 00:16:26.110
It's all certain type of addictions.

00:16:26.110 --> 00:16:27.730
Some people do that just for a living.

00:16:27.730 --> 00:16:28.635
Some people do that

00:16:28.635 --> 00:16:29.720
because that's what they like,

00:16:29.720 --> 00:16:31.130
that's their preference.

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:32.660
You understand what I'm sayin'?

00:16:32.660 --> 00:16:33.820
Some people do it because

00:16:33.820 --> 00:16:35.150
that's all they have to do, you know,

00:16:35.150 --> 00:16:36.463
they don't have a choice.

00:16:37.510 --> 00:16:39.433
It's all based on choices.

00:16:44.980 --> 00:16:46.610
- [Mark] What was the
best time of your life?

00:16:47.846 --> 00:16:52.310
- (sighs deeply) I
don't know, I can't say.

00:16:52.310 --> 00:16:55.323
Well, when I got married, yes, yeah.

00:16:56.614 --> 00:16:57.447
One of my best times.

00:16:57.447 --> 00:16:58.910
- [Mark] Which was recently.

00:16:58.910 --> 00:17:00.790
- No, 18 years ago.
- [Mark] Oh, 18 years ago.

00:17:00.790 --> 00:17:01.750
You've been married 18 years?

00:17:01.750 --> 00:17:03.670
- Yes sir.
- [Mark] Wow.

00:17:03.670 --> 00:17:05.950
- My husband is disabled now but um...

00:17:08.492 --> 00:17:10.593
(tongue clicks) We have a history.

00:17:16.120 --> 00:17:17.010
- [Mark] What's the most important lesson

00:17:17.010 --> 00:17:18.210
you've learned, in life?

00:17:21.430 --> 00:17:22.263
- Hmm.

00:17:23.270 --> 00:17:24.630
If I knew then what I know now,

00:17:24.630 --> 00:17:27.130
there's no way I would
ever got involved in drugs.

00:17:29.580 --> 00:17:32.450
And if I can, teach somebody else that,

00:17:32.450 --> 00:17:33.320
you know,

00:17:33.320 --> 00:17:35.650
explain it to 'em, or tell 'em about it.

00:17:35.650 --> 00:17:36.483
Don't do it.

00:17:36.483 --> 00:17:37.316
If you don't do drugs,

00:17:37.316 --> 00:17:39.180
don't let nobody entice you,

00:17:39.180 --> 00:17:40.150
trick you, none of that.

00:17:40.150 --> 00:17:42.373
'Cause it's not a good thing to do.

00:17:44.351 --> 00:17:45.240
It's not.

00:17:45.240 --> 00:17:46.073
- [Mark] All right, Tanya.

00:17:46.073 --> 00:17:47.220
Well thank you for sharing your story.

00:17:47.220 --> 00:17:48.470
- Absolutely, no problem.

00:17:48.470 --> 00:17:49.704
- [Mark] It was nice
hearing your whole life.

00:17:49.704 --> 00:17:51.454
- Great.
- Thank you.

